00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:51,000
And so, hedge ratio is

834
00:42:51,000 --> 00:42:55,000
shares sold, shares purchased over options.

835
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:58,000
Each option is to buy one share.

836
00:42:58,000 --> 00:42:59,000
Okay.

837
00:42:59,000 --> 00:43:02,000
So, what I'm going to do is

838
00:43:02,000 --> 00:43:05,000
write one call and buy H shares.

839
00:43:05,000 --> 00:43:09,000
So, let me erase this and start over again.

840
00:43:09,000 --> 00:43:10,000
Okay.

841
00:43:10,000 --> 00:43:11,000
So, I'm going to buy one call.

842
00:43:11,000 --> 00:43:14,500
I'm on my way to

843
00:43:14,500 --> 00:43:18,000
deriving the options price for you.

844
00:43:18,000 --> 00:43:23,000
And it's a little bit of math, but we'll get.

845
00:43:23,000 --> 00:43:25,000
Okay.

846
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:30,000
So, I'm going to write

847
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:35,000
one call and buy H shares.

848
00:43:35,000 --> 00:43:36,000
Okay.

849
00:43:36,000 --> 00:43:38,000
So, I'm going to write one call.

850
00:43:38,000 --> 00:43:40,000
And buy H shares.

851
00:43:40,000 --> 00:43:41,000
Okay.

852
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:43,000
So, I'm going to write one call.

853
00:43:43,000 --> 00:43:45,000
And I'm going to write one call.

854
00:43:45,000 --> 00:43:46,000
Okay.

855
00:43:46,000 --> 00:43:50,000
If the stock goes up, if we live in an

856
00:43:50,000 --> 00:43:54,000
up, if we discover we're in an up world next period,

857
00:43:54,000 --> 00:44:04,000
my portfolio is worth UHS minus C sub U. Right?

858
00:44:04,000 --> 00:44:07,000
Because the share price goes from S to U.S.

859
00:44:07,000 --> 00:44:09,000
And I've got H shares.

860
00:44:09,000 --> 00:44:10,000
So, I'm going to buy one call.

861
00:44:10,000 --> 00:44:11,000
And I'm going to write one call.

862
00:44:11,000 --> 00:44:12,000
And I've written a call.

863
00:44:12,000 --> 00:44:19,000
So, I have to pay C sub U.

864
00:44:19,000 --> 00:44:26,750
If it's down, then my portfolio

865
00:44:26,750 --> 00:44:34,500
is DHS minus C sub D. Okay.

866
00:44:34,500 --> 00:44:36,000
This is simple enough.

867
00:44:36,000 --> 00:44:39,000
Now, what I want to do is eliminate.

868
00:44:39,000 --> 00:44:41,000
I want to eliminate all risk.

869
00:44:41,000 --> 00:44:44,000
So, that means I want to choose H,

870
00:44:44,000 --> 00:44:47,000
