1091
00:56:20,000 --> 00:56:26,000
And calculate the implied volatility of stock prices.

1092
00:56:26,000 --> 00:56:29,000
So, when call option prices are high,

1093
00:56:29,000 --> 00:56:31,000
why is that, why are

1094
00:56:31,000 --> 00:56:33,000
